//! Valid values for tzSignal are:
//!   - EPWM_TZ_SIGNAL_CAPEVT_OST    - One-shot CAPEVT
//!   - EPWM_TZ_SIGNAL_CAPEVT_CBC    - Cycle By Cycle CAPEVT
